@startuml SD-DEPLOY-01-web-login
title SD-DEPLOY-01: Luồng Đăng Nhập Web Production qua Nginx (Same-Origin)

autonumber
actor "Người dùng (Browser)" as User
participant "Trình duyệt Web\n(Origin: http://1.55.58.251)" as Browser
participant "Nginx Reverse Proxy\n(Port 80/443)" as Nginx
participant "Auth Router\n(FastAPI)" as Router
participant "Auth Service" as Service
participant "User Repository" as Repo
database "MongoDB" as DB

User -> Browser: Nhập Email & Mật khẩu -> Bấm "Đăng nhập"
Browser -> Browser: Gọi hàm API với relative path:\nfetch("/api/v1/auth/login", { method: "POST", credentials: "include" })

note over Browser
  <b>Không có CORS Preflight:</b>
  Vì request cùng Scheme, Host, Port với trang web
  (Same-Origin) nên trình duyệt gửi request trực tiếp!
end note

Browser -> Nginx: POST /api/v1/auth/login
activate Nginx

Nginx -> Nginx: Bổ sung headers:\nX-Real-IP: $remote_addr\nX-Forwarded-For: $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for\nX-Forwarded-Proto: $scheme

Nginx -> Router: proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/login
activate Router

Router -> Service: authenticate_user(email, password)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: get_by_email(email)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: findOne({ email: "admin@tourvoice.vn" })
activate DB
DB --> Repo: user document (kèm password hash)
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: UserEntity
deactivate Repo

Service -> Service: Xác thực bcrypt password hash
Service -> Service: Sinh Access Token (JWT - 15p)\nSinh Refresh Token (Opaque Token)

Service --> Router: (user_profile, access_token, refresh_token)
deactivate Service

Router -> Router: Thiết lập HttpOnly Cookie:\nSet-Cookie: tourvoice_refresh_token=...; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax

Router --> Nginx: 200 OK { success: true, access_token, user }
deactivate Router

Nginx --> Browser: 200 OK { success: true, access_token, user }\nSet-Cookie: tourvoice_refresh_token=...
deactivate Nginx

Browser -> Browser: Lưu access_token vào bộ nhớ / state\nLưu user profile hiển thị giao diện
Browser --> User: Đăng nhập thành công! Chuyển hướng vào Dashboard

@enduml
